    "faq_group_6fAU3Q": {
      "type": "faq-group",
      "blocks": {
        "question_C8h6EJ": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "How can I determine my ring size?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can I determine my ring size?",
            "answer": "<p>We know that finding the right ring size can feel a little daunting, particularly when the piece is intended as a surprise.</p><p>For the most accurate result, we recommend visiting one of our retail locations for an in-person sizing consultation or contacting our Customer Service team to request a ring sizer. If you are purchasing a ring as a surprise, our Ring Size Guide also includes some helpful guidance.</p><p>If you are unable to visit our showrooms, you can purchase our self ring sizing tool here.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_pfeVEQ": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "  How can I choose the right necklace or chain length?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can I choose the right necklace or chain length?",
            "answer": "<p>Each of our necklaces is offered in the length we feel best complements the design, with thoughtful consideration given to how it can be worn alone or layered with our other pieces.</p><p>If you prefer a different length, please contact our Customer Service team before placing your order. They will be happy to discuss the available options and advise whether an alternative or customised chain length is possible for your chosen piece.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_C83a7e": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "  Can I request a ring size or chain length that is not listed online?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I request a ring size or chain length that is not listed online?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. If your preferred ring size or chain length is not available online, please contact our Customer Service Team. They will be happy to discuss your requirements and work with you to find the most suitable option for your chosen piece.</p><p>Please note that availability may depend on the design, materials and construction of the piece, and additional costs or production time may apply.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_eaAVQr": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "How does sizing work for men’s rings and signet rings?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does sizing work for men’s rings and signet rings?",
            "answer": "<p>Finding the correct size is especially important for men’s rings and wedding bands. Wherever possible, we recommend visiting one of our showrooms so our team can professionally size your finger and help you find the most comfortable fit.</p><p>If visiting us is not possible, we recommend being professionally sized by a jeweller. When being measured, please let them know the width and depth of your chosen ring – these measurements are available on each product page – as wider or heavier bands may require a slightly larger size for a comfortable fit.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_yHB6i8": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "Can I customise or personalise an existing NMJ design? ",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I customise or personalise an existing NMJ design?",
            "answer": "<p>Where possible, we would be happy to help you make an existing NMJ design feel uniquely your own. Depending on the piece, customisation options may include changes to the metal, stones, sizing or personal details such as engraving.</p><p>Please contact our Customer Service team before placing your order. They can discuss what may be possible and provide a personalised quotation for your requested changes. As each design is carefully considered, some customisations may not be suitable or achievable.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_bber38": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "Do you offer engraving?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you offer engraving?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, we offer hand engraving on selected pieces. Hand engraving is a highly specialised art form that we are proud to support, helping to preserve this beautiful, time-honoured craft for generations to come. Where engraving is available, the options and maximum number of characters will be listed on the relevant product page.</p><p>If you are considering a more detailed or customised engraving – such as a family crest, illustration or motif on a signet face – please contact our Customer Service team with your design details. We will be happy to discuss what may be possible and provide a personalised quotation based on the complexity and feasibility of your chosen design.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_Qbw4Wz": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "What happens if I order the wrong ring size?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What happens if I order the wrong ring size?",
            "answer": "<p>Please contact our Customer Service team as soon as possible so we can review the available options with you.</p><p>If you need to change a size before production begins, please get in touch within 24 hours of placing your order. We will always make reasonable efforts to accommodate your request, although changes cannot be guaranteed once work on your piece has commenced.</p><p>Depending on the change required, additional costs or an adjustment to the production timeframe may apply. We will always discuss this with you before proceeding.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_FBPtXf": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "Can all NMJ rings be resized?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can all NMJ rings be resized?",
            "answer": "<p>Not every ring can be resized, as suitability depends on the individual design, construction, materials, stone setting and the extent of the adjustment required.</p><p>Every resizing request is carefully assessed by our Production team to ensure the integrity of your piece is protected. Some designs may have limited resizing capacity or may not be suitable for resizing at all.</p><p>Where applicable, resize eligibility will be noted on the individual product page. Our Customer Service team is also available to guide you before ordering.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
