    "faq_group_83dgBF": {
      "type": "faq-group",
      "blocks": {
        "question_frTPUi": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "What is the difference between Made to Order and Ready to Wear?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the difference between Made to Order and Ready to Wear?",
            "answer": "<p>Most of our jewellery is Made to Order, meaning it is handcrafted especially for you once your order has been confirmed. The estimated production timeframe for each piece is displayed on its individual product page.</p><p>Ready to Wear pieces have already been crafted and are generally available for dispatch within two business days of order confirmation. If resizing, personalisation or another customisation is required, a longer timeframe may apply.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_qjadMc": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "How long will my order take to make?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long will my order take to make?",
            "answer": "<p>As many of our pieces are handcrafted to order, production timeframes vary depending on the design and the process involved in bringing it to life.</p><p>The estimated production timeframe is displayed on the individual product page and begins on the first business day after your order is confirmed. Please keep in mind that this timeframe does not include shipping or delivery.</p><p>While we take great care to meet our estimated timeframes, occasional delays may occur due to material availability, production requirements or other unforeseen circumstances. If a significant delay affects your order, we will contact you as soon as possible.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_fGGnzc": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "Can you accommodate an urgent order or a particular date?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can you accommodate an urgent order or a particular date?",
            "answer": "<p>If you require your piece by a particular date, please contact our Customer Service team before placing your order.</p><p>We will always do our best to accommodate meaningful dates wherever possible and can advise whether your requested timeframe is achievable. However, delivery by a particular date cannot be guaranteed unless it has been expressly confirmed by our team.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_zdVHJ6": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "Can I change or cancel my order after it has been placed?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I change or cancel my order after it has been placed?",
            "answer": "<p>If you would like to make a change to your order, please contact our Customer Service Team as soon as possible.</p><p>Requests to change a size or add or update personalisation should be made within 24 hours of placing your order. As many of our pieces are made especially for you, changes may not be possible once production has commenced.</p><p>We will always do our best to accommodate your request where possible and will let you know if any additional costs or changes to the production timeframe apply before proceeding.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_aMCkiW": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "Can I change my personal or delivery details after ordering?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I change my personal or delivery details after ordering?",
            "answer": "<p>If your order has not yet been dispatched, we may be able to update your contact details or delivery address.</p><p>Please contact our Customer Service team as soon as you notice an error. We will do our best to help, although changes cannot always be accommodated once an order has been processed or prepared for dispatch.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_p8Q7Wx": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "How can I check the status of my order?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can I check the status of my order?",
            "answer": "<p>An estimated production timeframe is provided on each product page as a guide. As many of our pieces are handcrafted to order, these timeframes may vary slightly depending on the intricacy of the design and the individual production process.</p><p>Our Customer Care team will be in touch if we anticipate any delays to your order. If you would like an update at any stage, please contact us with your order details and our team will be happy to check its progress for you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_4jxDRy": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "How will my order be packaged and presented?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How will my order be packaged and presented?",
            "answer": "<p>Your piece will arrive beautifully presented in our signature NMJ jewellery box. Orders being delivered will be carefully protected inside a cardboard shipping box, cushioned with shredded PEFC-certified shredded paper and enclosed in a compostable mailer.</p><p>Our beaded Sashi and Sana necklaces will arrive in our custom embroidered NMJ linen pouch. While our tennis & Ember bracelets and necklaces will arrive in our exclusive NMJ timber boxes.</p><p>If you select gift wrapping at checkout, your piece will be finished in our signature NMJ wrapping and tied with a ribbon made from 100% Australian grown cotton, ready to gift to someone special.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_V7Dwen": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "Can I include a gift message?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I include a gift message?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, you can add a personal gift message at checkout. Your message will be beautifully handwritten on a card and thoughtfully enclosed with your order.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_NTNmL4": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "Do you offer gift cards?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you offer gift cards?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, Natalie Marie Jewellery gift cards can be purchased online or from one of our retail locations.</p><p>Digital gift cards are delivered to the email address provided at purchase and can be redeemed online or in store. Physical gift cards are available in store or can be posted to you.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
