    "faq_group_UBLz7i": {
      "type": "faq-group",
      "blocks": {
        "question_H9kRD3": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "What delivery and showroom collection options do you offer?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What delivery and showroom collection options do you offer?",
            "answer": "<p>Australian orders are sent using Australian Post Express Post or DHL Express, depending on the service selected at checkout and its availability for your location.</p><p>Selected international orders are sent using DHL Express. Local collection may also be available from our Avalon and Paddington showrooms where this option is offered at checkout.</p><p>The available options, pricing and estimated delivery timeframes for your order will be displayed at checkout.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_GbDtyt": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "Do you offer complimentary shipping?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you offer complimentary shipping?",
            "answer": "<p>We offer complimentary shipping on One of a Kind and Bespoke pieces, as well as eligible orders valued at $1,000 AUD or more.</p><p>Complimentary shipping is subject to destination and service availability. Any applicable charges or exclusions will be clearly displayed at checkout.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_C3WPzF": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "How can I track my order?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can I track my order?",
            "answer": "<p>Once your piece has been carefully prepared and dispatched, we will send you a shipping confirmation email containing your tracking information.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_TeEY3w": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "Do you ship internationally?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you ship internationally?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, we ship to selected international destinations using registered and trackable DHL Express services.</p><p>The destinations and shipping options available will be displayed at checkout.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_pmxp3J": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "  Will I need to sign for my delivery?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will I need to sign for my delivery?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. As an additional measure of care and security, all orders require a signature on delivery unless otherwise expressly stated.</p><p>Please ensure the delivery address and contact information provided at checkout are complete and accurate.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_DdpPWh": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "What happens if I miss my delivery?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What happens if I miss my delivery?",
            "answer": "<p>If no one is available to receive your order, the courier will leave instructions outlining the next steps. Depending on the delivery provider, your parcel may be taken to a nearby collection point or made available for redelivery.</p><p>Please follow the instructions provided by the courier and collect your parcel within the nominated timeframe. If you experience any issues, contact our Customer Service team and we will be happy to assist where possible.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_ywghYP": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "What should I do if tracking shows my order as delivered but I cannot locate it?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What should I do if tracking shows my order as delivered but I cannot locate it?",
            "answer": "<p>If your tracking shows that your order has been delivered but you cannot locate it, we recommend first checking around the delivery address, including any safe-drop locations, and asking other members of your household, building management or neighbours whether they accepted it on your behalf.</p><p>If your parcel is still missing, please contact the delivery provider directly and notify our Customer Service team as soon as possible. We will work with you and the courier to investigate the delivery.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_tHBnaG": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "Is my jewellery insured while in transit? ",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is my jewellery insured while in transit?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, your jewellery is insured by NMJ while it is in transit to you. Once your order has been delivered and signed for, responsibility for the piece passes to you.</p><p>We recommend arranging appropriate insurance for your piece once it has been received. This can help protect it against accidental damage, loss or theft beyond the coverage provided by our warranty.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_JJYW9A": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "  Will I need to pay international duties and taxes?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will I need to pay international duties and taxes?",
            "answer": "<p>International orders may be subject to import duties, taxes, customs fees or other charges imposed by the destination country.</p><p>Unless these charges are expressly included and collected at checkout, they will be the responsibility of the recipient. As customs requirements vary between countries, we recommend contacting your local customs authority before purchasing if you would like further information.</p><p>Orders refused due to unpaid duties, taxes or customs charges will not be eligible for a refund. Unclaimed packages will be managed in accordance with the carrier’s applicable terms and conditions.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
