    "faq_group_XRBnGz": {
      "type": "faq-group",
      "blocks": {
        "question_MQEa8y": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "What engagement ring styles do you offer?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What engagement ring styles do you offer?",
            "answer": "<p>Our online engagement collection includes a thoughtfully curated range of designs, from refined solitaires and timeless trilogies to more intricate, vintage inspired settings.</p><p>Many of our designs can be created with your choice of precious metal, stone type, shape and size, allowing you to find a ring that feels uniquely yours. If you are looking for something truly individual, our bespoke engagement ring service will pair you with one of our dedicated designers, who will work closely with you to create a ring that thoughtfully reflects your vision.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_BM4VGj": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "What is the difference between an online and a bespoke engagement ring?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the difference between an online and a bespoke engagement ring?",
            "answer": "<p>Our online engagement rings are thoughtfully designed NMJ pieces that can be purchased through our website or in one of our showrooms. Once your order has been placed, our dedicated Production team will carefully select the best available stone for your ring in accordance with our stringent quality specifications. Your piece will then be individually crafted for you, bringing your chosen design to life with care and consideration.</p><p>Our bespoke service offers a more personalised design experience. You will be paired with a dedicated bespoke designer who will guide you through each stage of the process, from exploring your ideas and sourcing stones for you to view, through to refining the final design. You will also receive drawings and sketches to review and approve before your ring enters production.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_CPNV4m": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "Can I customise an NMJ engagement ring?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I customise an NMJ engagement ring?",
            "answer": "<p>Our laboratory-grown diamond engagement rings are available in a considered selection of stone sizes. For designs featuring larger stones, we have thoughtfully increased the band dimensions to ensure the setting remains beautifully balanced while supporting the strength and integrity of your ring.</p><p>You can personalise your piece with custom hand engraving or a hidden stone, creating a meaningful detail that is uniquely yours.</p><p>If you are considering further customisations, please contact our Customer Service team. They will guide you through the available options or, where appropriate, pair you with a dedicated bespoke designer to begin your bespoke journey.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_XkLTCE": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "How do I choose the right metal, diamond or gemstone?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I choose the right metal, diamond or gemstone?",
            "answer": "<p>Choosing the right materials for your ring is a deeply personal decision, guided by your individual style, lifestyle, values and budget.</p><p>When selecting a precious metal, consider the colour you are naturally drawn to, the jewellery you already wear and how your ring will suit everyday life. Your choice of diamond or gemstone may be influenced by its shape, colour, rarity, origin and the story or meaning it holds for you.</p><p>Our team can guide you through the differences between yellow, rose and white gold and platinum, as well as natural diamonds, laboratory-grown diamonds and coloured gemstones. Visit one of our showrooms or book an engagement or bespoke appointment to explore the options and find the combination that feels most like you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_KMNGJP": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "How do you source stones for your engagement rings?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do you source stones for your engagement rings?",
            "answer": "<p>Our dedicated in-house Diamond and Gemstone Specialist sources a stone for each engagement ring as it is ordered. Working within our stringent quality specifications, they carefully consider the available options and select the stone that best complements your chosen design, size and setting.</p><p>This considered approach allows us to select the best available stone for your individual piece, ensuring every engagement ring is brought to life with exceptional care and attention to detail.</p><p>Through our bespoke services, clients can choose to explore the extensive options of stones available, from coloured stones to mined or laboratory grown diamonds.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_n9pr4A": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "How long will my engagement ring take to make?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long will my engagement ring take to make?",
            "answer": "<p>As each engagement ring is individually crafted for you, production timeframes will vary depending on the design and level of customisation. The estimated production timeframe for our online engagement rings is provided on each product page as a guide.</p><p>For bespoke engagement rings, your designer will provide an estimated timeframe as part of the design process, once the details of your piece have been confirmed.</p><p>If you are working toward a particular date, please let our team know as early as possible. While we cannot always accommodate shorter timeframes, we will be happy to discuss the available options with you. If we anticipate any delays once your order is in production, our Customer Care team will keep you informed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_JDJHJd": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "Can you accommodate a particular proposal date?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can you accommodate a particular proposal date?",
            "answer": "<p>If you are planning to propose on a particular date, please let us know as early as possible and before placing your order. Our Customer Care team will review the production requirements of your chosen ring and advise whether your preferred timeframe can be accommodated.</p><p>While we will always do our best to work toward meaningful dates, shorter production timeframes cannot always be guaranteed. If a made-to-order or bespoke ring cannot be completed in time, our team may be able to guide you toward another suitable option.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_dUcFtL": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "How can I ensure my engagement ring will sit with a wedding band?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can I ensure my engagement ring will sit with a wedding band?",
            "answer": "<p>The profile and setting of your engagement ring will determine how it sits alongside a wedding band. Some designs allow a straight band to sit flush, while others may pair more beautifully with a curved or contoured band.</p><p>If you plan to wear the two rings together, we recommend considering your wedding band during the engagement ring selection process. Our team can guide you through compatible pairings and help you find pieces that feel balanced and comfortable when worn together.</p><p>You are welcome to visit one of our showrooms with your engagement ring or book a ceremonial appointment to explore the options in person. If an existing band is not quite right, we can also discuss creating a bespoke wedding band designed to complement your engagement ring.</p><p></p>"
          }
        },
        "question_qF8pba": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "Can my engagement ring be resized if it does not fit?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can my engagement ring be resized if it does not fit?",
            "answer": "<p>Eligible Engagement, Bespoke and Ceremonial rings receive one complimentary resize when requested within six months of the original purchase date.</p><p>Every resize is carefully assessed to ensure it can be completed without compromising the integrity of the design. Eligibility depends on the piece and will be noted on the individual product page.</p><p>Any additional resizing, or resizing requested outside the complimentary period, will be assessed and quoted separately.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_b9Dktx": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "What warranty, servicing and care come with my engagement ring?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What warranty, servicing and care come with my engagement ring?",
            "answer": "<p>Our Engagement and Bespoke pieces are created to be worn and treasured for a lifetime.</p><p>They are covered by a limited lifetime manufacturer’s warranty for eligible manufacturing and craftmanship faults, subject to our Terms. Eligible Engagement and Bespoke pieces also receive complimentary lifetime routine servicing.</p><p>To help preserve the beauty and integrity of your piece, we recommend returning it to NMJ every 12 months for inspection and servicing.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_nmRzLW": {
          "type": "question",
          "name": "Do you work with heirloom or customer-supplied stones?",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you work with heirloom or customer-supplied stones?",
            "answer": "<p>We may work with client-supplied heirloom stones through our Heirloom Service.</p><p>Every supplied stone and piece must first be carefully assessed by our team. Heirloom and previously worn materials can carry existing wear or structural vulnerabilities, and not every stone will be suitable for resetting or for the proposed design.</p><p>Where we consider a stone to be unsuitable, we may decline to use it in order to protect both the material and the integrity of the finished piece.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
